<title>HONG KONG: Chase amends pay date on China Investment Bank FRN.</title>
<headline>Chase amends pay date on China Investment Bank FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bookrunner Chase Manhattan Asia has announced that the payment date for the following transaction for China Investment Bank has been changed to May 27 from May 26.</p>
<p>Details of the transaction, which was launched and closed on April 17, are as follows:</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHINA INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$100 MLN  COUPON	6ML+45   MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	   ISS PRICE   PAR	RE-OFFER  PAR</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	 NONE     LAUNCH    17.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT   BULLET   REPLIES   17.APR.97</p>
<p> RATING     BAA3*	 SALES LMTS  STANDARD DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF     YES	FORCE MAJ IPMA2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH     HOME CTRY   CHINA    PAY DATE  27.MAY.97</p>
<p> FEES	 35BP  SPLIT MGT/UND     15BP     SELLING   20BP</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGERS   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK HONG KONG BRANCH, CHASE</p>
<p>		     MANHATTAN ASIA (BOOKS), DAIWA SECURITIES HONG</p>
<p>		     KONG, HSBC MARKETS AND STANDARD CHARTERED BANK.</p>
<p> NOTES   *ISSUER RATING</p>
<p>	   ISIN CODE XS75770528</p>
<p>	   A GROUP IS BEING FORMED</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
